Active
To activate the breakpoint, select the check box.
To deactivate the breakpoint, clear it. Plant Simulation then does not stop at this breakpoint anymore.
Start Time
Type in the Start Time at which the breakpoint is going to be activated. Plant Simulation only stops if the
EventController has reached or exceeded that point in time.
Condition
Type in the Condition which Plant Simulation evaluates each time when the breakpoint is reached. Plant
Simulation only stops if the condition is fulfilled.
